# story/03b-room.scene — bible.md spine, the room between the found
# document and the confrontation. Per docs/plans/wave2.md section 2
# and section 4 ("Room scenes"): Clipi's interior during the reboot,
# a symptom that appears once. Clipi has no sprite here and speaks
# only as `clipi:` lines; the room itself is the interface. All three
# object beats live here: the chest (count-herd), the window
# (flavor), the door (exit to confrontation, which sets its own bg).

== clipi_room
mode inner
bg clipi_room
hide slim
hide terminal
hide clipi
hide cargo_bot
> The floor holds. Drawers, a window, a door: none of it Clipi's, all of it Clipi.
-> room_hub

== room_hub
mode inner
choice
    "Open the chest of drawers." -> room_chest [if not herd_done]
    "Look out the window." -> room_window
    "Go through the door." -> confrontation [if herd_done]

== room_chest
mode inner
clipi: Top drawer first, Slim. Then whatever's still in the chest under it.
puzzle count-herd
    pass -> room_chest_pass
    lockout -> room_chest_lockout

== room_chest_pass
set herd_done = true
clipi: Counted clean. No wrecks left in that drawer.
-> room_hub

== room_chest_lockout
set herd_done = true
clipi: Leave it shut. I know what's in there now.
-> room_hub

== room_window
mode inner
if clipi_stable
    > A strip of desert shows through the glass, sun flat on the salt pan.
else
    > The glass holds only static, grey and even as sand.
clipi: You can stop looking at me through the eye. I already know you're there.
-> room_hub
